<view class="community earnings"><view class="title">收益数据</view><view class="muted">每一份专业交付，都有迹可循</view>
<view wx:if="{{error}}" class="error" bindtap="retry">{{error}} · 点击重试</view>
<block wx:if="{{info}}"><view class="notice">{{info.basis}}</view><view wx:if="{{info.paymentMode==='mock'}}" class="notice">当前为模拟支付环境，以下数据不代表真实资金。</view>
<view class="income-hero"><text>累计已完成订单金额</text><view class="total">¥{{info.amounts.completed}}</view><text>完成 {{info.summary.completedCount}} 单 · 非到账余额</text></view>
<view class="metrics"><view class="card"><text>本月完成</text><view>¥{{info.amounts.month}}</view></view><view class="card"><text>履约中 / 待验收</text><view>¥{{info.amounts.active}}</view></view><view class="card"><text>退款 / 纠纷处理中</text><view>¥{{info.amounts.held}}</view></view></view>
<view class="card"><view class="title">近六个月完成金额</view><view wx:for="{{info.trend}}" wx:key="month" class="trend-row"><view class="between"><text>{{item.month}}</text><text>¥{{item.amount}}</text></view><view class="track"><view class="bar" style="width:{{item.width}}%"/></view></view></view>
<view class="title">订单金额明细</view><view class="card between" wx:for="{{items}}" wx:key="id" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="open"><view class="grow"><view class="item-title">{{item.projectName}}</view><view class="caption">{{item.label}} · 查看订单 ›</view></view><text class="money">¥{{item.amount}}</text></view><view wx:if="{{!items.length}}" class="empty">暂无有成功支付记录的承接订单</view><button wx:if="{{nextOffset!==null}}" bindtap="more" loading="{{loading}}">加载更多</button></block><view wx:if="{{loading}}" class="empty">正在加载…</view></view>
